  "Test and debug your device directly in the Developer Console — without first building an App, MQTT client or WebRTC Viewer. Select a Product and device to send and receive MQTT messages, read or update Device Shadow state, and view live video over WebRTC. Use these tools to check device behavior and troubleshoot cloud integration before writing your own application. Available tests depend on your permissions and the services enabled for the selected device.": "直接在開發者主控台中測試和除錯您的裝置——無需先構建應用程式、MQTT用戶端或WebRTC檢視器。選擇一個產品和裝置來傳送和接收MQTT訊息、讀取或更新裝置影子狀態，並透過WebRTC檢視實時影片。在編寫您自己的應用程式之前，使用這些工具檢查裝置的行為並進行雲整合故障排除。可用的測試取決於您的許可權和為所選裝置啟用的服務。",
  "Test authorization expires after 5 minutes. MQTT credentials renew through a fresh connection; messages during renewal may be missed. Playback stops after 85 seconds. Operations affect your real device.": "測試授權在5分鐘後到期。MQTT憑據透過重新連線續訂；續訂期間的訊息可能會錯過。播放在85秒後停止。操作會影響您的真實裝置。",
  "Test protocol": "測試協議",
  "The Billing server estimates costs using the applicable pricing version. The end-of-month forecast is not a final invoice.": "計費伺服器使用適用的定價版本估算成本。月底預測不是最終發票。",
  "The Brand Cloud, products, and other resources covered by your roles.": "品牌雲、產品和其他您的職責涵蓋的資源。",
  "The account currency is not supported for payment.": "不支援該帳戶貨幣進行付款。",
  "The address may be outdated, or the page may have moved. Use a safe starting point to continue.": "地址可能已過時，或者頁面可能已移動。請使用安全的起點繼續。",
  "The available balance must be nonnegative (zero is allowed), and Billing must confirm settlement with no unresolved financial work.": "可用餘額必須是非負數（允許為零），並且賬單必須確認結算，並且沒有未解決的財務工作。",
  "The balance must first return above the threshold before low-balance monitoring resumes.": "在恢復低餘額監控之前，餘額必須首先恢復到超過閾值。",
  "The billing operation did not complete. No charge was submitted or repeated.": "賬單操作未完成。沒有提交或重複提交任何費用。",
  "The charge has failed {{count}} consecutive times and will be disabled after the third failure.": "充電失敗了{{count}}連續幾次，第三次失敗後將被停用。",
  "The cloud ID and tenant slug do not change when renamed.": "雲ID和租戶slug在更名時不會發生變化。",
  "The cloud owner selects Share cloud and enters the email of a registered, verified developer. The invitee accepts using the matching account; invitations expire after 30 minutes.": "雲主選取「共享雲」，然後輸入已註冊、已驗證的開發人員的電子郵件。受邀者使用匹配的帳戶接受邀請；邀請在30分鐘後過期。",
  "The device query service is temporarily unavailable.": "裝置查詢服務暫時不可用。",
  "The download contains private keys. Keep it secure and do not share it in source control, logs, or support screenshots.": "下載包含私鑰。請確保其安全，不要在源控制、日誌或支援螢幕截圖中共享。",
  "The email link is missing its token. Open the original invitation link again.": "電子郵件連結缺少令牌。請再次開啟原始邀請連結。",
  "The last valid data remains available to downstream consumers. Check the provider endpoint.": "最後有效的資料仍然可用於下游消費者。請檢查提供商端點。",
  "The latest synchronization failed. The last valid snapshot remains available.": "最新的同步失敗了。最後有效的快照仍然可用。",
  "The owner can change, disable or remove a member's access. Review pending invitations, resend an unchanged invitation, or cancel it before inviting with a different role or scope. Removing access invalidates Product grants; rejoining does not restore them automatically.": "所有者可以更改、停用或刪除會員的訪問許可權。檢視待處理的邀請，重新發送未變更的邀請，或在邀請具有不同角色或範圍之前取消它。刪除訪問許可權會使產品授權失效；重新加入不會自動恢復它們。",
  "The owner receives the global account activation email; no tenant password is created.": "業主會收到全球帳戶啟動電子郵件；不會建立租戶密碼。",
  "The payment method does not yet have merchant-initiated charge capability; the save button remains disabled and no charge will be submitted.": "該付款方式尚未具有商家啟動的收費功能；儲存按鈕仍然停用，不會提交任何收費。",
  "The payment service has not completed automatic-charge eligibility verification, so no charge was submitted.": "支付服務尚未完成自動收費資格驗證，因此沒有提交收費。",
  "The payment service is not configured.": "支付服務未配置。",
  "The payment service is temporarily unavailable. Please try again later.": "支付服務暫時不可用。請稍後再試。",
  "The provider action could not be completed.": "無法完成供應商操作。",
  "The provider draft could not be saved.": "無法儲存供應商草案。",
  "The provider’s latest sync failed. These are the last successfully published board resources.": "供應商的最新同步失敗了。這些是最後一次成功釋出的板塊資源。",
  "The report could not be completed. Please try again.": "無法完成報告。請重試。",
  "The role determines what can be done, and the scope determines which Products, Regions, Groups, or Devices can be managed.": "角色決定了可以做什麼，範圍決定了可以管理哪些產品、地區、組或裝置。",
  "The secret is required when saving or re-enabling the subscription; it is never displayed after submission.": "儲存或重新啟用訂閱時需要密碼；提交後永遠不會顯示。",
  "The selected payment method is inactive.": "所選付款方式已停用。",
  "The settings were changed by another operation. Refresh and try again.": "設定已被另一個操作更改。請重新整理並重試。",
  "The top-up amount does not meet the configured rules.": "充值金額不符合配置的規則。",
  "The unique owner has switched. Recovery must finish forward; there is no switch-back action. The new owner must set up their own payment method and consent after finalization.": "獨家所有者已切換。恢復必須向前進行；沒有回撥操作。新所有者必須在完成後設定自己的付款方式並同意。",
  "The version must be uploaded and checked before it can be published to the update plan.": "版本必須上傳並檢查後才能釋出到更新計劃中。",
  "The version will be registered to": "該版本將被註冊到",
  "Then start the burn. The tool will immediately handshake with the bootloader.": "然後開始燒錄。該工具將立即與引導程式進行握手。",
  "There are currently no Brand Cloud members.": "目前沒有品牌雲會員。",
  "There are currently no OTA rollouts for this Product.": "目前此產品沒有OTA推出。",
