  "There are currently no firmware updates.": "目前沒有韌體更新。",
  "There are currently no invoices.": "目前沒有發票。",
  "There is currently no billing activity.": "目前沒有計費活動。",
  "This Shadow does not exist yet. Use Update desired to create it.": "這個影子還不存在。請使用「更新所需」來建立它。",
  "This console page is unavailable.": "此主控台頁面不可用。",
  "This disables the Product; it does not delete its devices, firmware or history, and does not make the cloud empty.": "這會停用該產品；它不會刪除其裝置、韌體或歷史記錄，也不會使雲端空空如也。",
  "This example is not in the selected release.": "這個示例不在所選版本中。",
  "This is not a read-only role. Its existing cloud permissions apply; it still does not grant ownership or Billing access.": "這不是一個只讀角色。其現有的雲許可權適用；它仍然不會授予所有權或計費訪問許可權。",
  "This limits how long leaked credentials or forgotten test devices can be used. After expiry, the certificate cannot authenticate new connections; create a new test device to continue testing. Creating another device does not revoke the old certificate or extend its expiry.": "這限制了洩露的憑據或忘記的測試裝置可以使用多長時間。過期後，證書無法驗證新的連線；建立一個新的測試裝置以繼續測試。建立另一個裝置不會撤銷舊證書或延長其到期日期。",
  "This reset link is not valid": "此重置連結無效",
