  "Test and debug your device directly in the Developer Console — without first building an App, MQTT client or WebRTC Viewer. Select a Product and device to send and receive MQTT messages, read or update Device Shadow state, and view live video over WebRTC. Use these tools to check device behavior and troubleshoot cloud integration before writing your own application. Available tests depend on your permissions and the services enabled for the selected device.": "直接在开发者控制台中测试和除错您的装置——无需先构建应用程式、MQTT用户端或WebRTC检视器。选择一个产品和装置来传送和接收MQTT讯息、读取或更新装置影子状态，并透过WebRTC检视实时影片。在编写您自己的应用程式之前，使用这些工具检查装置的行为并进行云整合故障排除。可用的测试取决于您的许可权和为所选装置启用的服务。",
  "Test authorization expires after 5 minutes. MQTT credentials renew through a fresh connection; messages during renewal may be missed. Playback stops after 85 seconds. Operations affect your real device.": "测试授权在5分钟后到期。MQTT凭据透过重新连线续订；续订期间的讯息可能会错过。播放在85秒后停止。操作会影响您的真实装置。",
  "Test protocol": "测试协议",
  "The Billing server estimates costs using the applicable pricing version. The end-of-month forecast is not a final invoice.": "计费伺服器使用适用的定价版本估算成本。月底预测不是最终发票。",
  "The Brand Cloud, products, and other resources covered by your roles.": "品牌云、产品和其他您的职责涵盖的资源。",
  "The account currency is not supported for payment.": "不支援该帐户货币进行付款。",
  "The address may be outdated, or the page may have moved. Use a safe starting point to continue.": "地址可能已过时，或者页面可能已移动。请使用安全的起点继续。",
  "The available balance must be nonnegative (zero is allowed), and Billing must confirm settlement with no unresolved financial work.": "可用余额必须是非负数（允许为零），并且账单必须确认结算，并且没有未解决的财务工作。",
  "The balance must first return above the threshold before low-balance monitoring resumes.": "在恢复低余额监控之前，余额必须首先恢复到超过阈值。",
  "The billing operation did not complete. No charge was submitted or repeated.": "账单操作未完成。没有提交或重复提交任何费用。",
  "The charge has failed {{count}} consecutive times and will be disabled after the third failure.": "充电失败了{{count}}连续几次，第三次失败后将被停用。",
  "The cloud ID and tenant slug do not change when renamed.": "云ID和租户slug在更名时不会发生变化。",
  "The cloud owner selects Share cloud and enters the email of a registered, verified developer. The invitee accepts using the matching account; invitations expire after 30 minutes.": "云主选取「共享云」，然后输入已注册、已验证的开发人员的电子邮件。受邀者使用匹配的帐户接受邀请；邀请在30分钟后过期。",
  "The device query service is temporarily unavailable.": "装置查询服务暂时不可用。",
  "The download contains private keys. Keep it secure and do not share it in source control, logs, or support screenshots.": "下载包含私钥。请确保其安全，不要在源控制、日志或支援萤幕截图中共享。",
  "The email link is missing its token. Open the original invitation link again.": "电子邮件连结缺少令牌。请再次开启原始邀请连结。",
  "The last valid data remains available to downstream consumers. Check the provider endpoint.": "最后有效的资料仍然可用于下游消费者。请检查提供商端点。",
  "The latest synchronization failed. The last valid snapshot remains available.": "最新的同步失败了。最后有效的快照仍然可用。",
  "The owner can change, disable or remove a member's access. Review pending invitations, resend an unchanged invitation, or cancel it before inviting with a different role or scope. Removing access invalidates Product grants; rejoining does not restore them automatically.": "所有者可以更改、停用或删除会员的访问许可权。检视待处理的邀请，重新发送未变更的邀请，或在邀请具有不同角色或范围之前取消它。删除访问许可权会使产品授权失效；重新加入不会自动恢复它们。",
  "The owner receives the global account activation email; no tenant password is created.": "业主会收到全球帐户启动电子邮件；不会建立租户密码。",
  "The payment method does not yet have merchant-initiated charge capability; the save button remains disabled and no charge will be submitted.": "该付款方式尚未具有商家启动的收费功能；储存按钮仍然停用，不会提交任何收费。",
  "The payment service has not completed automatic-charge eligibility verification, so no charge was submitted.": "支付服务尚未完成自动收费资格验证，因此没有提交收费。",
