  "The provider’s latest sync failed. These are the last successfully published board resources.": "供应商的最新同步失败了。这些是最后一次成功释出的板块资源。",
  "The report could not be completed. Please try again.": "无法完成报告。请重试。",
  "The role determines what can be done, and the scope determines which Products, Regions, Groups, or Devices can be managed.": "角色决定了可以做什么，范围决定了可以管理哪些产品、地区、组或装置。",
  "The secret is required when saving or re-enabling the subscription; it is never displayed after submission.": "储存或重新启用订阅时需要密码；提交后永远不会显示。",
  "The selected payment method is inactive.": "所选付款方式已停用。",
  "The settings were changed by another operation. Refresh and try again.": "设定已被另一个操作更改。请重新整理并重试。",
  "The top-up amount does not meet the configured rules.": "充值金额不符合配置的规则。",
  "The unique owner has switched. Recovery must finish forward; there is no switch-back action. The new owner must set up their own payment method and consent after finalization.": "独家所有者已切换。恢复必须向前进行；没有回拨操作。新所有者必须在完成后设定自己的付款方式并同意。",
  "The version must be uploaded and checked before it can be published to the update plan.": "版本必须上传并检查后才能释出到更新计划中。",
  "The version will be registered to": "该版本将被注册到",
  "Then start the burn. The tool will immediately handshake with the bootloader.": "然后开始烧录。该工具将立即与引导程式进行握手。",
